cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Please cite this software when using these analyses.
type: software
title: Wound single-cell measurement construct validation
authors:
- family-names: Fu
  given-names: Zeyu
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: Software for testing whether a fibroblast-associated expression loading
  reflects cell-state abundance and supports patient-level healing inference in public
  wound single-cell data. The study includes technical controls, patient resampling,
  paired anatomy, representation comparisons and external tissue-context projections.
  It does not establish a clinically validated prognostic tool.
repository-code: https://github.com/PeterPonyu/wound-measurement-construct
keywords:
- single-cell transcriptomics
- wound healing
- measurement validity
